{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29d2ee57593609072cec64cab4b640d3ee4f77a4d900b3ebe2edadc338035162", "ja": "（仕事も一区切りしたし、少し休憩しようかな。\nあれ？　あそこにいるのは……ひなた？）", "zh": "（工作也告一段落了，稍微休息一下吧。\n咦？在那里的是……日向？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b8d4a888d68d7dfd102c81a39ae7431fbc4ed5d6e55fac8e73fe36a33ab6ed1b", "ja": "おーい、ひなた。\n今日は確か、オフじゃなかったか？", "zh": "喂，日向。  \n我记得你今天不是休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "3ed632116c89afe96389c1f728ef5f623ca3fa27950455b2b065122dc4751bb5", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさんです。今日はね、\n{$P$}に会いに来たんだべさ。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。今天嘛，是来见{$P$}的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "0e7c5b9367014302505551b5c21ab95b199c39f339856a2d297143ab4ca84304", "ja": "実は、その……この服、あたしに似合ってるか、\n聞きたくってねぇ。", "zh": "其实，那个……我想问问，\n这身衣服适合我吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1004_p", "source_sha256": "62a032ee9a16b6ee6caf89e423db3e6ff44a0108b143d02b63e90fff9534175e", "ja": "感想を？　それは構わないけど……。\nそういえば、その服は初めて見た気がするな。", "zh": "想听听感想？这倒是没问题，不过……\n这么说来，我好像还是第一次见你穿这身衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "efe9c7e2f85548bc8d1d5ae3c068b583c775d4e1a8b9e3e40fe1cd42e692e474", "ja": "あ、うん……。実はね、\nこの服を着るのは、今日が初めてなんだ。", "zh": "啊，嗯……其实呢，\n今天还是第一次穿这身衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c928b3dac015743a6016c008da9713ec2d11201d6fcd0f8338b14662850d59fd", "ja": "……そうなのか？", "zh": "……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "6e8f6d8e29726a0a9b402a9eefc26a202a2eedad9d299d69321ca59801c8b428", "ja": "そうだよぉ。素敵なお店がたくさんあって、\n結構迷ったけど……。自分ひとりで選んでみたんだ。", "zh": "对呀。有好多很棒的店，我还纠结了好一会儿……不过最后还是自己一个人挑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3d4f8530c93f5c8cb9e62703e644166fed33393e02bc8ea01b508c03ef25254c", "ja": "ひとりで！？\nおお～、すごいじゃないか！", "zh": "一个人！？\n哦～真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "0649cff2b552091a9effd43fcc08f4d86df7c17d0ac303306a04d4c65b2cc3e6", "ja": "えへへ……。あたし、前までは、\nあんまし服のこととかわかんなかったんだ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……我以前啊，不太懂衣服之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "1d76ee79a2c0b9a5c791c6b765b0f82058bdc6e84169409f39affa69e3f087d2", "ja": "でもアイドルになって、みんなが洋服について教えて\nくれてねぇ。それで、ちょっと挑戦してみたんだぁ。", "zh": "不过，成为偶像后，大家教了我好多服装方面的知识。所以，我也稍微挑战了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "60216fdaecc7e709b85f681386a38ad14e3b3058c8716b9956e307eae9025eaf", "ja": "えっと……どうだい、{$P$}？\nちゃんと似合ってるだろうか？", "zh": "那个……怎么样，{$P$}？\n很适合我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e0bec3d7f8e654bb2c7a009e14151b1ba953c15970feb45c8e8007db267a5da3", "ja": "もちろん！　服も髪型もすごくいいぞ。\nひなたらしくて、可愛くて。", "zh": "当然！衣服和发型都非常合适。\n很有日向的风格，也很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "c0fcd4d66de47974515a790d78cd2f2f8ec12d0a036525f336bf40b45d3c1cfc", "ja": "わぁ……本当かい？　{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえると、うれしいべさ。", "zh": "哇……真的吗？能得到{$P$}\n这么夸奖，俺好高兴呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a46e997693251e87b694bdcc849c3e0052e9ef86c9c6913ae1e36a9fa0c83c3", "ja": "どれが一番似合うかなって、\nいっぱい考えたかいがあったよぉ。えへへ。", "zh": "为了想选出最适合的那件，我可是费了不少心思呢。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fe605b3a12a1630265863a9ba5f7452bc8ea113c4592085b0c8c76f2dd49dc55", "ja": "ははっ。ひなたが頑張って選ぶ姿が浮かぶよ。\nけど……お披露目が、今日でよかったのか？", "zh": "哈哈，我都能想象出小日向努力挑选的样子了。\n不过……今天就公开亮相，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1016_p", "source_sha256": "945a8849657048414ffde4866e30543ad70cdc76ad57e7db7791fed6f9e762f9", "ja": "それこそ俺なんかより、\n劇場のみんなに見てもらった方が……。", "zh": "比起我来，还是让剧场的大家看看更好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "920e118dd213e36bf374fb4f5d7da5394d882c1c54802f70ba9fd03e00631a2d", "ja": "ううん。一番最初は、\n{$P$}って決めてたんだ。", "zh": "不。我早就决定好了，\n第一个一定要给{$P$}看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "92c88e582d29492709d3306cde03786ccb9e8588e60bb5ab798acb72277af29a", "ja": "今のあたしを見たら、どんな感想をくれるのかなって。\n選びながら、ずっと思ってたんだよぉ。", "zh": "看到现在的我，不知道会给我什么样的评价呢。我一边挑选，一直都在这么想着哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9396f8fffbbd220a8d9d04be01c4150e10d71332a45c6ab40b4dfd1bcac9ffb9", "ja": "ひなた……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "c1754887270321068969f887dd6ca35e1f9055ec6b4bd273f537204b8897332a", "ja": "だって衣装を着た時も、感想をくれるっしょや？\nそれが、すっごくうれしくってねぇ。", "zh": "因为每次我穿上服装，你都会告诉我感想，对吧？\n那让我特别开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "2df36d651fed27b1df93bb0d5925f67b3fc701a2d3ee7e168d043ddbac68963f", "ja": "今回は衣装じゃないけど……\n感想を聞かせてくれるとうれしいなぁ。", "zh": "这次不是服装，不过……\n要是能告诉我你的感想，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0464_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "e2a31a6255ccb1cc8f0ef57ed079c7278ef2912f3b811d25c42137b83727f9b1", "ja": "今日だけじゃなくて、これからも……\n新しい服を買った時は見せに来ていいかい？", "zh": "不只是今天，以后也……买了新衣服的时候，可以过来给你看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
